WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.934
-Finally, we have
exactly 12 shows left

00:00:02.934 --> 00:00:05.434
before we go on Christmas break,
which means it's time for that

00:00:05.434 --> 00:00:07.100
beloved "Tonight Show"
tradition.

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:11.534
It's time for
"12 Days of Christmas Sweaters"!

00:00:11.534 --> 00:00:13.934
-♪ "12 Days of
Christmas Sweaters" ♪

00:00:13.934 --> 00:00:19.000
♪ 12 days left ♪

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.133
-That's right.

00:00:20.133 --> 00:00:23.634
Every show between
now and Christmas,

00:00:23.634 --> 00:00:26.467
we will be giving
one lucky audience member

00:00:26.467 --> 00:00:28.901
a spectacular Christmas sweater

00:00:28.901 --> 00:00:30.801
from the Countdown
to Christmas Cabinet.

00:00:30.801 --> 00:00:35.167
Since there are 12 shows left,
let's open door number 12.

00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:37.167
[ Drumroll ]

00:00:39.767 --> 00:00:41.234
Whoa!

00:00:41.234 --> 00:00:42.467
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:45.601 --> 00:00:47.901
Wow. This is gorgeous.
Look at this.

00:00:56.701 --> 00:01:00.400
I don't know what that is.
Holy moly.

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:02.501
Alright, now let's see

00:01:02.501 --> 00:01:03.701
who's going home with
tonight's sweater.

00:01:03.701 --> 00:01:05.701
Everyone look
at your seat number, okay?

00:01:05.701 --> 00:01:07.601
If I call your number,
I need you to jump up

00:01:07.601 --> 00:01:08.767
and let me know where you are.

00:01:08.767 --> 00:01:09.868
Quest, can I get
a drumroll, please?

00:01:09.868 --> 00:01:10.901
[ Drumroll ]

00:01:10.901 --> 00:01:11.968
Who wants me
to pick their number?

00:01:11.968 --> 00:01:13.434
It's a good sweater.

00:01:13.434 --> 00:01:15.100
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:17.234 --> 00:01:19.601
442!

00:01:19.601 --> 00:01:21.601
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.000
Hi!

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:33.601
How you doing?
-Good. How are you?

00:01:33.601 --> 00:01:34.734
-I'm fantastic.

00:01:34.734 --> 00:01:35.934
What is your name
and where are you from?

00:01:35.934 --> 00:01:39.133
-Maria from Colombia.
-Maria from Colombia!

00:01:39.133 --> 00:01:41.801
Oh, my goodness.

00:01:41.801 --> 00:01:43.434
Maria, you have
a beautiful sweater on.

00:01:43.434 --> 00:01:46.133
Does it get
a little chilly in Colombia?

00:01:46.133 --> 00:01:47.534
-Um, no.
-No.

00:01:47.534 --> 00:01:49.968
So this is perfect,
because those rare occasions

00:01:49.968 --> 00:01:52.567
