you're going to have something.

00:01:52.567 --> 00:01:54.467
Do you have anything like this?
-No.

00:01:54.467 --> 00:01:56.734
-No. Would you like to
try it on?

00:01:56.734 --> 00:01:58.000
-Of course.
-Oh, my God.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:01:59.567
Guys, give it up for
Maria from Colombia.

00:01:59.567 --> 00:02:01.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:05.801 --> 00:02:09.801
You got your gla-- Oh.

00:02:09.801 --> 00:02:11.000
-Thank you.
-No pr--

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:14.467
Oh, Maria, this is --
I mean, this is gor--

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:16.667
Look at this. That's gorgeous.

00:02:16.667 --> 00:02:19.000
Oh, you're a model.
Thank you so much.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:21.667
Give it up for Maria, everybody.
Thanks again.

00:02:21.667 --> 00:02:25.133
Stick around. We'll be
right back with Olivia Rodrigo!

